WEBVTT

00:01:00.667 --> 00:01:03.018
There was a time
in which the economics profession

00:01:03.042 --> 00:01:04.518
worked in the public interest,

00:01:04.542 --> 00:01:06.434
but in the neoliberal era,

00:01:06.458 --> 00:01:08.184
today,

00:01:08.208 --> 00:01:10.643
they work only for big corporations

00:01:10.667 --> 00:01:12.226
and billionaires,

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:14.833
and that is creating
a little bit of a problem.

00:01:15.792 --> 00:01:19.601
We could choose to enact economic policies

00:01:19.625 --> 00:01:21.500
that raise taxes on the rich,

00:01:22.417 --> 00:01:26.268
regulate powerful corporations
or raise wages for workers.

00:01:26.292 --> 00:01:27.809
We have done it before.

00:01:27.833 --> 00:01:30.309
But neoliberal economists would warn